// ISA-95 (B2MML V0700): the graph model and sample data
//
// Generated by ../../cypher.py from model.json and sample.json. Edit those and regenerate, rather than this file.
//
// One day of production at the Halden plant of Nordcell, a fictional battery cell manufacturer, following an ISA-95
// exchange from the ERP to the MES and back: the role-based equipment hierarchy down to a coater and a dryer, the
// classes, people and anode slurry the area works with, and the process segments that coat and dry an electrode. The
// MES receives an operations schedule, its request and the equipment, material and personnel each segment needs, and
// reports the operations performance back, with what each segment actually used and when it ran.
//
// Run it against an empty database of Neo4j 5 or later, Enterprise Edition, for its node key and property existence
// constraints, e.g. with cypher-shell -f model.cypher. It merges every node and relationship, so it can be run again.

// The model: its constraints

